/-- The standard simplex in the space of functions `ι → 𝕜` is the set of vectors with non-negative
coordinates with total sum `1`. This is the free object in the category of convex spaces. -/
def stdSimplex : Set (ι → 𝕜) :=
  { f | (∀ x, 0 ≤ f x) ∧ ∑ x, f x = 1 }

